{
  "id": "ZEC.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Zacarías 10",
  "copyright": "Reina-Valera 1909 - Dominio público. Fue realizada por Sociedades Bíblicas Unidas y publicada por primera vez en 1909.",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PEDID á Jehová",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "lluvia en la sazón tardía: Jehová hará relámpagos, y os dará lluvia abundante, y hierba en el campo á cada uno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Porque las imágenes han hablado vanidad, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "los adivinos han visto mentira, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "han hablado sueños vanos, en vano consuelan: por lo cual se fueron ellos como ovejas, fueron humillados",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "porque no",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "tuvieron",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.10.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pastor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Contra los pastores se ha encendido mi enojo, y castigaré",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "los machos de cabrío: mas Jehová de los ejércitos visitará su rebaño, la casa de Judá, y tornarálos como su caballo de honor en la guerra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "De él saldrá el",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ángulo, de él la",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "clavija, de él",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "el arco de la guerra, de él también todo apremiador.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y serán como valientes, que en la batalla pisan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "al enemigo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en el lodo de las calles; y pelearán, porque Jehová",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "será",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "con ellos; y los que cabalgan en caballos serán avergonzados.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Porque yo fortificaré la casa de Judá, y guardaré la casa de José; y harélos volver, porque de ellos tendré piedad; y serán como si no los hubiera desechado; porque yo soy Jehová su Dios, que los oiré.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1 \"Las ovejas de la matanza.\"",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2 \"Suavidad y Ataduras.\"",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y será Ephraim como valiente, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "alegraráse su corazón como de vino: sus hijos también verán y se alegrarán; su corazón se gozará en Jehová.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "les silbaré y los juntaré, porque los he redimido; y serán multiplicados como fueron multiplicados.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bien que",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "los sembraré entre los pueblos,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "aun en lejanos países se acordarán de mí; y vivirán con sus hijos, y tornarán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Porque yo los tornaré de la tierra de Egipto, y los recogeré",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de la Asiria; y traerélos á la tierra de Galaad y del Líbano, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "no les bastará.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y la tribulación",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "pasará por la mar, y en la mar herirá las ondas, y se secarán todas las honduras del río: y la soberbia del Assur será derribada, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "se perderá el cetro de Egipto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Y yo los fortificaré en Jehová, y",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "caminarán en su nombre, dice Jehová.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ZEC.11",
    "number": "11",
    "bookId": "ZEC"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ZEC.9",
    "number": "9",
